      '**The Narrative of Progress:** Choosing a lab-grown diamond is an investment in a future shaped by human innovation and conscious values. Over 70% of millennial buyers now prefer lab-grown diamonds.',
      'At Luminore Jewelry, we honor both narratives. The most valuable diamond is the one that captures your heart and reflects your story.'
